WEBVTT

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:04.140
to access your Microsoft Office programs

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:06.600
you would need to go down at the Start

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:08.460
menu which involve left-hand corner if

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.809
you click on the windows icon that will

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:13.620
bring up a list of programs that are

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:15.299
installed on your computer everything is

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:16.920
installed alphabetically so as you

00:00:15.299 --> 00:00:20.510
scroll down you will see the programs

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:24.510
that have been installed such as Excel

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:25.859
