00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:30.179
course to access the program you would

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:32.910
simply click on the word icon and then

00:00:30.179 --> 00:00:34.770
that would open up Microsoft Word to

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:36.149
make it easier to access your software

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:37.980
without having to go through the storm

00:00:36.149 --> 00:00:40.469
and you you can't right click on that

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:43.350
and then select a more option and pin to

00:00:40.469 --> 00:00:45.660
taskbar this will then place the icon on

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:47.399
your taskbar so by clicking on that that

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:49.079
will open the program directly without

00:00:47.399 --> 00:00:51.420
having to go through the Start menu you

00:00:49.079 --> 00:00:53.070
can then do this for your PowerPoint and

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:56.010
your Excel which will just speed things

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:58.530
up a little bit if I click on the icon

00:00:56.010 --> 00:01:02.300
